uma tosta... para...

281
00:19:01,561 --> 00:19:03,562
...entra nessa, baby...

282
00:19:05,564 --> 00:19:08,401
Yeah, yeah, yeah...

283
00:19:08,484 --> 00:19:10,986
Entra nessa!

284
