As coisa vão mudar.
Vou melhorar, combinado?

1041
01:16:50,317 --> 01:16:52,235
Amo-te.

1042
01:16:56,531 --> 01:16:58,616
Linda menina.

1043
01:17:05,498 --> 01:17:08,291
