Jack, atenção!

1120
01:23:49,079 --> 01:23:51,206
Whoa!

1121
01:25:19,664 --> 01:25:21,624
Batemos.

1122
01:25:27,546 --> 01:25:29,089
Batemos!

1123
01:25:39,891 --> 01:25:41,600
Louise?

1124
